- ## Prompt Enhancer Iteration
- Some ERNIE-Image surfaces show the enhanced prompt used after generation. If an enhanced prompt is available, copy it and iterate from that text instead of starting over. Edit only the failing parts: text placement, exact wording, object count, lighting, or composition.
- Use `use_pe=true` to expand short creative prompts. Use `use_pe=false` when exact text, labels, flowchart order, UI text, multi-panel order, or character consistency matters.
- ## Exclusion Constraints
- This skill's API call does not send a separate `negative_prompt` field. Put exclusions into the positive prompt as natural language constraints, for example:
- - `avoid cluttered background`
- - `no visible watermark`
- - `without extra text overlays`
- - `keep the title uncropped`
- - `avoid distorted letters`
